Doorkeeper brings Bharata and Lakṣmaṇa to Rāma --- Rāma embraces brothers and proposes Rājasūya sacrifice --- Rāma cites Mitra and Sōma winning eminence through Rājasūya --- Rāma asks brothers for timely counsel --- Bharata bows and hails Rāma as dharma and refuge --- Bharata warns Rājasūya spells ruin for earthly royal lines --- Bharata says protecting subjects equals sacrifice --- Delighted Rāma withdraws from Rājasūya on Bharata advice